WEBVTT

00:00:16.890 --> 00:00:18.840
We're sorry, Number One.

00:00:18.930 --> 00:00:23.930
We just couldn't find the last of the
six swords on the plains of Suriagehara.

00:00:24.020 --> 00:00:25.810
No problem.

00:00:28.230 --> 00:00:31.020
These'll do me just fine.

00:00:55.800 --> 00:00:57.340
Master Katakura?!

00:00:58.010 --> 00:01:00.630
What's the meaning of this, Kojuro?

00:01:00.720 --> 00:01:03.970
I, Kojuro, must commit suicide.

00:01:04.060 --> 00:01:05.560
Eh?

00:01:05.640 --> 00:01:08.230
At this battle at Hitotoribashi...

00:01:08.310 --> 00:01:10.050
We may have secured victory for ourselves,

00:01:10.150 --> 00:01:14.020
but even though I swore to protect your back,

00:01:14.110 --> 00:01:16.650
I allowed you to suffer a grievous wound.

00:01:16.740 --> 00:01:18.570
It's just a scratch.

00:01:18.660 --> 00:01:20.160
No, my lord.

00:01:20.240 --> 00:01:21.530
With the slightest deviation,

00:01:21.620 --> 00:01:23.830
it is a sword wound that
could have robbed you not only

00:01:23.910 --> 00:01:27.030
of the use of your swords, but of your life!

00:01:31.710 --> 00:01:35.300
I realize this is highly irregular, but...

00:01:38.140 --> 00:01:40.050
I will die now to pay for my mistake.

00:01:40.140 --> 00:01:41.340
Wait, Master Katakura!

00:01:41.430 --> 00:01:42.590
Y-Y-You can't do this!

00:01:42.680 --> 00:01:44.590
H-H-H-H-Hold on!

00:01:44.680 --> 00:01:47.720
All right. I'll be your second.

00:01:47.810 --> 00:01:50.300
What?!

00:01:50.400 --> 00:01:52.930
Wait, Number One!

00:02:30.400 --> 00:02:31.810
N-Number One!

00:02:31.900 --> 00:02:34.260
W-With his injured right hand!

00:02:34.360 --> 00:02:36.720
And he was gouged to the bone, too!

00:02:36.820 --> 00:02:38.680
Th-That's crazy!

00:02:38.780 --> 00:02:40.770
Quit...

00:02:40.860 --> 00:02:44.400
...treating me like a brat forever.

00:02:44.490 --> 00:02:47.110
You're my Right Eye.

00:02:47.200 --> 00:02:48.940
If I ever lose my right arm,

00:02:49.040 --> 00:02:51.580
don't waste your time
slashing open your stomach.

00:02:51.670 --> 00:02:54.630
You become my right arm, too!

00:02:57.380 --> 00:03:01.000
As you can see, not a
single blade touched my back.

00:03:01.090 --> 00:03:05.840
On top of which...

00:03:05.930 --> 00:03:07.760
I can still wield these six swords

00:03:07.850 --> 00:03:10.510
tomorrow and beyond, the same as ever.

00:03:12.480 --> 00:03:15.020
It means there's no problem here.

00:03:15.110 --> 00:03:16.690
Isn't that right?

00:03:16.780 --> 00:03:19.390
Lord Masamune...

00:03:19.490 --> 00:03:21.650
Let's be cool about this.

00:03:23.370 --> 00:03:25.950
Please forgive me.

00:03:29.580 --> 00:03:34.750
I, Kojuro, will serve you
with even greater resolve.

00:03:34.840 --> 00:03:36.040
Once again...

00:03:36.130 --> 00:03:37.460
For your conquest of Oshu...

00:03:37.550 --> 00:03:40.330
Congratulations, my lord.

00:03:42.680 --> 00:03:44.460
Congratulations!

00:04:12.500 --> 00:04:14.280
Kojuro...

00:04:32.020 --> 00:04:33.800
Are you ready, guys?!

00:04:33.890 --> 00:04:35.350
Yeah!

00:04:35.440 --> 00:04:36.770
Hurry up!

00:04:36.860 --> 00:04:38.440
Yeah!

00:04:38.520 --> 00:04:40.100
Burning up!

00:04:40.190 --> 00:04:41.930
Yeah!

00:04:42.030 --> 00:04:43.770
We go there!

00:04:43.860 --> 00:04:45.650
Yeah!

00:04:50.870 --> 00:04:54.780
Number One, Uesugi's army is on
the other side of the Setogawa river!

00:04:54.870 --> 00:04:55.990
What?

00:04:56.080 --> 00:04:59.500
I don't think we'll be able to
get past their numbers that easily.

00:06:52.160 --> 00:06:54.820
Number One! It's no use!

00:06:54.910 --> 00:06:58.620
No matter what we say, those
Uesugi bastards are totally ignoring us.

00:06:58.710 --> 00:07:00.790
They've got all the paths
going around them blocked, too.

00:07:00.870 --> 00:07:05.790
And we haven't been able to spot
anyone resembling Uesugi Kenshin.

00:07:05.880 --> 00:07:09.870
Maybe the Uesugi have been
taken over by Toyotomi, too.

00:07:09.970 --> 00:07:11.470
Then, could there be others?!

00:07:11.550 --> 00:07:13.670
Are they trying to box us in again?!

00:07:13.760 --> 00:07:15.920
Be quiet.

00:07:16.010 --> 00:07:18.760
Getting all worked up about
this won't get us anywhere.

00:07:30.360 --> 00:07:32.150
Hitotoribashi, huh?

00:07:46.250 --> 00:07:48.710
Pardon my intrusion, my dear Katakura.

00:07:50.920 --> 00:07:53.840
Your lord really is something else.

00:07:53.930 --> 00:07:57.510
Nanbu, Tsugaru, Souma, and Ashina.

00:07:57.600 --> 00:08:01.180
It seems he didn't succumb,
even when boxed in by four armies.

00:08:03.350 --> 00:08:07.520
I didn't think the Date Army could
accomplish so much without you.

00:08:07.610 --> 00:08:10.940
Of course they could! You'd better
not underestimate Lord Masamune!

00:08:11.030 --> 00:08:12.060
Thanks to that...

00:08:12.150 --> 00:08:15.990
I had intended to have Hideyoshi
store up his energy for a while,

00:08:16.070 --> 00:08:20.030
but I wound up needing him
to pay a personal visit to Oshu.

00:08:20.120 --> 00:08:21.740
You can rest easy.

00:08:21.830 --> 00:08:24.200
As to the dear boy Masamune's fate...

00:08:24.290 --> 00:08:28.910
I won't tease you by not telling
you what ultimately happened.

00:08:36.680 --> 00:08:40.920
A souvenir for you, brought back by
a soldier who accompanied Hideyoshi.

00:08:41.020 --> 00:08:44.430
It's one of the dear boy
Masamune's six swords, right?

00:08:44.520 --> 00:08:48.480
I won't ask that you
join our cause immediately.

00:08:48.570 --> 00:08:54.530
First, I just want you to accept that
the man you used to serve is no more.

00:08:54.610 --> 00:08:57.070
I won't be able to wait for too long,

00:08:57.160 --> 00:09:01.700
but I believe I can sympathize
with how you feel right now.

00:09:06.790 --> 00:09:10.500
Such makeshift measures
are unnecessary, Hanbei.

00:09:10.590 --> 00:09:14.000
He will be of use to you, without fail.

00:09:14.090 --> 00:09:16.250
But I feel I must apologize.

00:09:16.340 --> 00:09:17.920
For what?

00:09:18.010 --> 00:09:20.970
For making you go to Oshu.

00:09:21.060 --> 00:09:24.420
You seemed particularly
concerned about the Date,

00:09:24.520 --> 00:09:26.430
so I merely went to see.

00:09:26.520 --> 00:09:31.230
I never imagined that they
would overcome being surrounded.

00:09:31.320 --> 00:09:33.100
First, my mishandling of
Kawanakajima and now this...

00:09:33.190 --> 00:09:35.400
I have utterly failed both times.

00:09:35.490 --> 00:09:37.270
Pay it no mind.

00:09:37.360 --> 00:09:39.030
For even I ended up returning

00:09:39.120 --> 00:09:43.400
without sending the injured
One-Eyed Dragon to his maker.

00:09:43.500 --> 00:09:46.660
True, that was unexpected, but...

00:10:00.800 --> 00:10:05.420
You must have had a good
reason for failing to finish him off.

00:10:09.230 --> 00:10:14.060
At the very least, right now,
we are free to invade Shikoku.

00:10:14.150 --> 00:10:21.110
Now, our highly trained army is
awaiting your orders to go to war.

00:10:21.200 --> 00:10:23.820
My mightiest soldiers,

00:10:23.910 --> 00:10:27.530
come reign supreme over the land with me!

00:10:27.620 --> 00:10:30.960
To keep this land of the rising sun
from becoming a country in ruin...

00:10:31.040 --> 00:10:34.000
To build a new era...

00:10:34.090 --> 00:10:37.550
We go to war!

00:11:16.550 --> 00:11:19.080
First, their standoff against the
Takeda at Kawanakajima and now this...

00:11:19.170 --> 00:11:21.710
They sure like to take their sweet time.

00:11:27.390 --> 00:11:29.850
The War God of Echigo...

00:11:33.560 --> 00:11:35.430
That's...

00:11:35.520 --> 00:11:38.190
Are we going to be fighting, Number One?

00:11:43.240 --> 00:11:46.320
You guys enjoy your
picnic for a while longer.

00:11:46.410 --> 00:11:48.200
Huh?

00:11:48.290 --> 00:11:51.490
Toyotomi isn't going anywhere.

00:11:51.580 --> 00:11:52.950
Lord Kenshin.

00:11:53.040 --> 00:11:55.160
Good work, Kasuga.

00:11:55.250 --> 00:11:57.380
It seems the aforementioned
alliance has now been formed.

00:11:57.460 --> 00:12:01.750
Toyotomi appears to be preparing
to send his main army west.

00:12:01.840 --> 00:12:05.930
As you suspected, it is believed
he will attack Shikoku with Mori.

00:12:06.010 --> 00:12:08.300
I see.

00:12:08.390 --> 00:12:11.680
And... about Maeda Keiji...

00:12:11.770 --> 00:12:14.260
It seems he headed for Osaka.

00:12:14.350 --> 00:12:16.350
Who knows what he intends to do...

00:12:16.440 --> 00:12:18.230
So you are concerned for him.

00:12:18.320 --> 00:12:18.980
What?

00:12:19.030 --> 00:12:24.740
N-No, I merely thought that
you might be anxious for him...

00:12:31.540 --> 00:12:33.650
My beautiful blade.

00:12:36.380 --> 00:12:42.710
I find your gentle nature truly endearing.

00:13:02.900 --> 00:13:05.020
So they're going to war.

00:13:15.500 --> 00:13:17.280
Hideyoshi!

00:13:25.880 --> 00:13:30.300
Hideyoshi! Wait! I need to talk to you!

00:13:30.390 --> 00:13:32.600
Dissolve your alliance with the Maeda!

00:13:32.680 --> 00:13:35.800
Stop trying to use force to
make everyone yield to you!

00:13:35.890 --> 00:13:37.260
Hideyoshi!

00:13:37.350 --> 00:13:40.690
Hideyoshi! Please!
Listen to what I have to say!

00:13:40.770 --> 00:13:42.560
Hideyoshi!

00:13:45.950 --> 00:13:50.190
You seem well, my dear Keiji.

00:13:50.280 --> 00:13:52.110
Hanbei.

00:13:52.200 --> 00:13:54.530
You haven't changed one bit.

00:13:54.620 --> 00:13:57.280
You've even got the same look about you.

00:13:57.370 --> 00:13:59.240
You haven't changed, either.

00:13:59.330 --> 00:14:03.120
I've heard the news from Tedorigawa.

00:14:03.210 --> 00:14:05.550
If you weren't an absconder,

00:14:05.630 --> 00:14:08.620
the Maeda Army itself would
have been held responsible

00:14:08.720 --> 00:14:11.430
for the show of hostility against Toyotomi.

00:14:11.510 --> 00:14:12.920
Remember that.

00:14:13.010 --> 00:14:16.970
The Maeda will not help
Toyotomi oppress the people.

00:14:17.060 --> 00:14:18.930
Let me talk to Hideyoshi!

00:14:19.020 --> 00:14:22.480
Hideyoshi has his gaze upon the world.

00:14:22.570 --> 00:14:27.030
A man who lives a debauched life
according to the wind and his whims...

00:14:27.110 --> 00:14:31.100
He will not hear such a man's words,
though you may yell them into his ear.

00:14:31.200 --> 00:14:34.160
It means he lives in a
different world than you.

00:14:35.870 --> 00:14:37.250
Who are you invading?!

00:14:37.330 --> 00:14:38.870
Is it Shikoku?!

00:15:06.230 --> 00:15:09.270
They do not have enough men here as well.

00:15:09.360 --> 00:15:14.700
Their fathers, husbands, and
sons have all been sent to war...

00:15:14.780 --> 00:15:16.290
Master Yukimura.

00:15:16.370 --> 00:15:17.700
Is something the matter?

00:15:17.790 --> 00:15:22.250
Oh, no, I owe you another apology
upon this occasion, Master Oyamada.

00:15:22.330 --> 00:15:23.830
I just could not bring myself to ignore it...

00:15:23.920 --> 00:15:25.030
Not at all.

00:15:25.130 --> 00:15:27.340
Now let us hurry on our way.

00:15:31.760 --> 00:15:33.550
For the future of the land of the rising sun,

00:15:33.640 --> 00:15:36.090
we wield our military might,
pride ourselves on our strength,

00:15:36.180 --> 00:15:38.260
and fight over this country with one another...

00:15:38.350 --> 00:15:42.760
I never questioned any of it in the slightest...

00:15:42.850 --> 00:15:47.140
But in all this time,
just how many people have...

00:15:58.490 --> 00:16:00.950
Please tell me, my lord.

00:16:01.040 --> 00:16:04.280
Is a peaceful land of the
rising sun truly before us...

00:16:04.380 --> 00:16:07.960
...at the end of all this warring?

00:16:14.140 --> 00:16:15.750
What is going on?

00:16:17.510 --> 00:16:19.890
Toyotomi's banner!

00:16:19.970 --> 00:16:23.220
Perhaps their alliance with
Mori has come to fruition.

00:16:23.310 --> 00:16:25.600
To invade Shikoku together.

00:16:25.690 --> 00:16:29.310
And do not forget that
we do not have a lot of time.

00:16:29.400 --> 00:16:31.310
How could I have let this happen?!

00:16:31.400 --> 00:16:35.070
I have been neglecting my
mission without realizing it!

00:16:35.160 --> 00:16:39.700
Please forgive me, my lord!

00:17:05.060 --> 00:17:09.480
The time has finally come for you
to reveal yourself as a contender.

00:17:09.570 --> 00:17:12.770
First, let us strike at the
deadlock at Kawanakajima.

00:17:12.860 --> 00:17:17.070
Takeda and Uesugi have stood off
against each other for some time now.

00:17:17.160 --> 00:17:18.070
Kojuro.

00:17:18.160 --> 00:17:19.490
My lord.

00:17:19.580 --> 00:17:25.160
Why did you try to commit
suicide after Hitotoribashi?

00:17:25.250 --> 00:17:26.700
That was because...

00:17:26.790 --> 00:17:28.280
...I was responsible

00:17:28.380 --> 00:17:31.290
for the grievous wound you
sustained during that battle.

00:17:31.380 --> 00:17:34.290
That wasn't all, was it?

00:17:34.380 --> 00:17:37.500
You were against us going to war that time.

00:17:37.590 --> 00:17:40.460
But I figured it was my chance
to unify Oshu in one fell swoop

00:17:40.560 --> 00:17:42.340
and took the offensive.

00:17:42.430 --> 00:17:44.920
As a result, we were victorious

00:17:45.020 --> 00:17:47.980
and the Date conquered Oshu.

00:17:48.060 --> 00:17:53.310
But we suffered unprecedented casualties.

00:17:53.400 --> 00:17:55.520
You were going to take
responsibility for the whole damn thing

00:17:55.610 --> 00:17:57.320
and on top of that,
you were going to make me...

00:17:57.410 --> 00:17:59.570
I had intended...

00:17:59.660 --> 00:18:05.320
...to have you experience
what it meant to suffer a true loss.

00:18:05.410 --> 00:18:06.780
Though you may win the war,

00:18:06.870 --> 00:18:10.830
if you have no one to share
the life that comes after...

00:18:10.920 --> 00:18:14.040
You were still young, and I, Kojuro,
had intended to have you realize this

00:18:14.130 --> 00:18:17.340
by having you lose your
Right Eye once again...

00:18:17.430 --> 00:18:19.840
Shut up!

00:18:19.930 --> 00:18:22.260
Don't you dare get all cocky on me!

00:18:40.360 --> 00:18:42.280
I'm no match for you.

00:18:42.370 --> 00:18:44.230
That's what it comes down to.

00:18:44.330 --> 00:18:46.440
Nothing could be farther from the truth.

00:18:48.660 --> 00:18:53.450
I won't let the Date Army
lose another soul ever again.

00:18:53.540 --> 00:18:55.380
Lord Masamune...

00:19:00.010 --> 00:19:02.500
My resolve is firm.

00:19:05.850 --> 00:19:08.180
Hey, Uesugi's pulling out!

00:19:08.270 --> 00:19:10.130
--Huh?
--They're leaving?!

00:19:10.230 --> 00:19:12.970
What the heck was that about?!

00:19:13.060 --> 00:19:19.030
Lord Kenshin, why did you
choose this place to stall Date?

00:19:19.110 --> 00:19:23.450
Before Date conquered all of Oshu,

00:19:23.530 --> 00:19:25.490
I am told this is where he
fought his most desperate battle

00:19:25.580 --> 00:19:29.440
and the battlefield where
he suffered his greatest losses.

00:19:29.540 --> 00:19:32.500
To calm the Dragon's impetuous soul,

00:19:32.580 --> 00:19:37.870
heal his wounds, and build up his strength...

00:19:37.960 --> 00:19:40.920
No other place could have served as well...

00:19:41.010 --> 00:19:42.790
Number One?

00:19:45.260 --> 00:19:47.800
I'm going to go say a quick thanks.

00:19:47.890 --> 00:19:51.130
With all due respect, why go to such lengths?

00:19:51.230 --> 00:19:53.090
Well, as for that...

00:19:53.190 --> 00:19:55.430
Date Masamune, the One-Eyed Dragon...

00:19:55.520 --> 00:19:58.860
He is none other than the
worthy rival of the young tiger,

00:19:58.940 --> 00:20:02.230
whom the Tiger of Kai
has mentored with great care.

00:20:02.320 --> 00:20:04.230
And because I believe

00:20:04.320 --> 00:20:06.230
he is a man equal to the
task of quelling the wars

00:20:06.330 --> 00:20:09.240
that will continue ceaselessly
as long as man shall live.

00:20:10.660 --> 00:20:12.450
Lord Kenshin?!

00:20:21.170 --> 00:20:23.430
I had a nice chance to cool down there.

00:20:23.510 --> 00:20:25.300
An indomitable spirit.

00:20:25.390 --> 00:20:27.840
The rest will be up to
your quality and Heaven's will.

00:20:27.930 --> 00:20:31.300
I'd say that was a clever
stunt you pulled there,

00:20:31.390 --> 00:20:34.350
but don't count me in your debt.

00:20:34.440 --> 00:20:36.020
You're going to regret this.

00:20:36.110 --> 00:20:40.470
If you should not return, I shall unify Oshu.

00:20:40.570 --> 00:20:44.560
It would not be so bad to seek
to conquer the country from there.

00:20:44.660 --> 00:20:46.940
So you may rest easy.

00:20:47.030 --> 00:20:49.150
You sure are a crafty one.

00:20:49.240 --> 00:20:52.030
There's something about you
that's a lot like the Tiger of Kai.

00:20:54.250 --> 00:20:56.830
You honor me.

00:21:01.380 --> 00:21:03.870
Okay, be enthusiastic!

00:21:03.970 --> 00:21:05.210
Yeah!

00:21:05.300 --> 00:21:06.710
Prepare the trigger!

00:21:06.800 --> 00:21:08.050
Yeah!

00:21:08.140 --> 00:21:11.170
Got it! This is the party
we've been waiting for!

00:21:11.270 --> 00:21:13.050
Yeah!

00:21:16.940 --> 00:21:18.640
At around the same time,
in the Inland Sea of Seto,

00:21:18.730 --> 00:21:21.220
Chosokabe of Shikoku and Mori of Aki

00:21:21.320 --> 00:21:25.230
had begun their battle for
supremacy in spectacular fashion.

00:21:28.160 --> 00:21:31.780
It doesn't matter if that bastard
joins forces with Toyotomi or what.

00:21:31.870 --> 00:21:34.830
We'll settle this right quick!

00:21:38.580 --> 00:21:42.670
Look at that! They're in a panic
because we've fired the first shots!

00:21:44.220 --> 00:21:46.920
The Fugaku's now complete
with the 1 1 -shaku giant barrel.

00:21:47.010 --> 00:21:48.750
With it, we'll defeat Mori in one fell swoop

00:21:48.840 --> 00:21:51.260
and we'll finally take the offensive
against the rest of the country!

00:21:51.350 --> 00:21:53.630
Got it, you sons of bitches?!

00:21:53.720 --> 00:21:56.640
Boss!

00:22:03.570 --> 00:22:07.650
Chosokabe's fortress, the Fugaku...

00:22:07.740 --> 00:22:10.230
That is a fine piece of work.

00:23:42.080 --> 00:23:43.540
You sons of bitches!

00:23:43.630 --> 00:23:45.960
In the next episode,
the Ogre of the Western Sea

00:23:46.050 --> 00:23:49.210
will be knocking out both
Toyotomi and Mori together!

00:23:49.380 --> 00:23:52.170
You folks in your living
rooms better get ready for it, too!

00:23:52.260 --> 00:23:53.420
Don't miss the boat as we
set sail to conquer the country!
